# Skill: project-board

## Board Identity

All commands target the **The-Replacement Roadmap** project board.

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Project number | `1` |
| Owner | `The-Replacement` |
| Project ID (GraphQL) | `PVT_kwDOE1iio84BrhYz` |

